  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>'</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></msqrt></mfrac><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>'</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Integrating both sides with respect to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
